In particular, $G/B$ is ${\mathbb A}^1$-connected, via the Bruhat decomposition and a geometric criterion for ${\mathbb A}^1$-connectedness.
\item Since $G/B$ is ${\mathbb A}^1$-connected, apply the ${\mathbb A}^1$-Hurewicz theorem to identify
